Package: agetime
Type: Package
Title: Work with Age, Period, and Cohort Labels
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    c(person(given = "John",
             family = "Bryant",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "john@bayesiandemography.com"),
      person(given = "Junni",
             family = "Zhang",
             role = "aut",
             email = "junni@bayesiandemography.com"))
Description: Work with vectors of age, period, and
    cohort labels. Infer the intervals underlying
    labels, and use this informtion to
    validate, reformat, and manipulate the labels.
    Common tasks such as filtering on age or
    combining datasets become easier and safer.
